    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/0056caf4f42f9387ed23eb965d0bc008.avif?t=1667223602\" /></div><br><br>PositronX is a futuristic rogue-lite fps featuring fast-paced combat, creative movement, time control mechanics and breathtaking visuals, each playthrough giving you a unique experience.<br><br><strong>Fight MACHINE SWARMS in a randomly generated fast paced old school shooter.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/17bfbcf9e71db00684b9469a47652bc4.avif?t=1667223602\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unrivaled <strong>first-person shooter feel</strong> and <strong>fluid movement</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ab696bc2cc3de3f096c27796a8f7c915.poster.avif?t=1667223602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ab696bc2cc3de3f096c27796a8f7c915.webm?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ab696bc2cc3de3f096c27796a8f7c915.mp4?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Mind-boggling <strong>time manipulation</strong> abilities<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/a1c78d2dfd8f492f308d90c55507abd9.poster.avif?t=1667223602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/a1c78d2dfd8f492f308d90c55507abd9.webm?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou